1
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:48,030
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,050 --> 00:01:51,080
[Episode 16]

3
00:02:04,850 --> 00:02:06,230
Did he come to see me

4
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,300
just to return my scarf?

5
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:10,690
Why does he

6
00:02:10,690 --> 00:02:12,090
seem a little impatient?

7
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:18,910
Hello?

8
00:02:18,910 --> 00:02:19,710
What's up?

9
00:02:19,710 --> 00:02:20,520
Hello, Li.

10
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,079
Did you guys meet?

11
00:02:22,079 --> 00:02:23,150
Did you give her the gift?

12
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:24,120
Did everything go smoothly?

13
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,750
I'm really annoyed right now.

14
00:02:25,750 --> 00:02:26,470
Can you stop bombarding me

15
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:28,020
with questions?

16
00:02:28,270 --> 00:02:29,680
What's wrong with you?

17
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,250
Nothing.

18
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,020
Are you in a bad mood?

19
00:02:36,090 --> 00:02:37,840
Weren't you meeting Yunyi

20
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,100
and her brother today?

21
00:02:39,810 --> 00:02:41,470
It has nothing to do with that.

22
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:42,870
Yunyi got the gift

23
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:43,520
you sent her,

24
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,920
and she was really happy.

25
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:45,520
If that's all,

26
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,410
I'm hanging up.

27
00:02:46,710 --> 00:02:47,910
Wait, one more thing.

28
00:02:48,410 --> 00:02:49,470
The robotics competition

29
00:02:49,470 --> 00:02:51,120
is tomorrow, right?

30
00:02:51,650 --> 00:02:52,870
There's a problem

31
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:54,120
I just can't figure out.

32
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,590
Can you ask that guy

33
00:02:55,590 --> 00:02:56,960
from XUST for me?

34
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:59,590
Why do you want me to ask him?

35
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,620
Who else am I supposed to ask? You?

36
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,470
I'm trying to give you

37
00:03:02,470 --> 00:03:03,650
a chance here.

38
00:03:03,810 --> 00:03:04,650
You have him on WeChat.

39
00:03:04,650 --> 00:03:05,650
Ask him yourself.

40
00:03:09,210 --> 00:03:09,960
Unbelievable! I try to help,

41
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,690
and you throw it back in my face!

42
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:28,000
Yun Ye,

43
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:29,150
what's up?

44
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:29,840
Hey, Shize.

45
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,460
I have a robotics competition

46
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:31,910
at the Science and Technology Festival
tomorrow,

47
00:03:31,910 --> 00:03:32,650
and there's something

48
00:03:32,650 --> 00:03:33,460
about my robot

49
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:34,620
I wanted to ask you.

50
00:03:34,620 --> 00:03:35,310
Go ahead.

51
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,800
It's the gait

52
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,860
and posture control.

53
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:38,800
It keeps being unstable.

54
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,020
I've adjusted it over and over

55
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:41,020
according to the manual,

56
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:41,860
but it's still not working.

57
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:43,020
Do you think it's a parameter issue

58
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:45,079
or a problem with the control system?

59
00:03:46,050 --> 00:03:47,250
For posture control,

60
00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:49,180
check the calibration

61
00:03:49,180 --> 00:03:51,079
of the gyroscope and accelerometer,

62
00:03:51,079 --> 00:03:52,210
as well as the PID parameters.

63
00:03:52,210 --> 00:03:53,750
See if they need fine-tuning.

64
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:54,970
If that doesn't work,

65
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:56,280
there might be a balancing issue

66
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,250
with the motor

67
00:03:57,250 --> 00:03:58,650
or transmission system.

68
00:03:58,650 --> 00:03:59,470
Check for any wear

69
00:03:59,470 --> 00:04:00,970
or deformation.

70
00:04:01,150 --> 00:04:02,310
I'll give that a try.

71
00:04:02,410 --> 00:04:03,470
Thanks, Shize!

72
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:04,910
You're seriously amazing.

73
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:05,590
Oh, by the way,

74
00:04:05,590 --> 00:04:06,620
isn't the handmade drone

75
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:08,370
my sister gave you super cool?

76
00:04:09,460 --> 00:04:10,190
I bet

77
00:04:10,190 --> 00:04:11,530
she stayed up all night

78
00:04:11,550 --> 00:04:12,770
making that drone.

79
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,480
The drone your sister gave me?

80
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,250
Yeah.

81
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:21,620
Wait, she hasn't given it to you yet?

82
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,480
Shize,

83
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,370
please pretend

84
00:04:25,370 --> 00:04:26,330
this never happened,

85
00:04:26,330 --> 00:04:28,270
or my sister will kill me!

86
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:32,920
I'll let you go now, Shize.

87
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:34,010
Thanks!

88
00:04:35,770 --> 00:04:36,950
Yun Li,

89
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:39,070
why are you taking so long
to give it to him?

90
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:40,400
Well, it's not my fault.

91
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,250
Mrs. Jiang.

92
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:50,770
How is Grandma?

93
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:52,220
There you are.

94
00:04:53,620 --> 00:04:55,620
She really gave us a scare this time.

95
00:04:56,130 --> 00:04:57,659
Your uncle stayed by her side
for two days

96
00:04:57,659 --> 00:04:58,930
and was completely worn out,

97
00:04:58,930 --> 00:05:00,790
so I sent him home to get some rest.

98
00:05:01,450 --> 00:05:02,250
Did the doctor say

99
00:05:02,250 --> 00:05:03,560
what caused it?

100
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:05,070
I won't know

101
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,010
until the test results

102
00:05:06,010 --> 00:05:07,130
come back.

103
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:10,100
Keep an eye on her for me.

104
00:05:10,100 --> 00:05:11,060
I'm going

105
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:12,300
to get the test results.

106
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:13,230
Okay, Ms. Jiang.

107
00:05:14,130 --> 00:05:16,060
Ring the bell if you need anything.

108
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:21,540
Hello?

109
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:23,010
Uncle,

110
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,250
tell Lili

111
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,720
I took care of it for her.

112
00:05:26,230 --> 00:05:27,290
I'm busy right now.

113
00:05:27,990 --> 00:05:29,140
Tell her yourself.

114
00:05:31,170 --> 00:05:31,990
Yuanyuan.

115
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,360
Grandma.

116
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,950
Do you have something urgent
to take care of?

117
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:37,450
No, I'm fine.

118
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:39,510
If you have things to do,

119
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:40,800
go ahead.

120
00:05:41,100 --> 00:05:42,100
It's okay.

121
00:05:43,100 --> 00:05:45,159
That's just how it is
when you get old.

122
00:05:45,500 --> 00:05:46,860
Something's bothering you one moment,

123
00:05:46,860 --> 00:05:48,460
and something else the next.

124
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:49,690
It's nothing.

125
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:51,420
You don't have

126
00:05:51,420 --> 00:05:53,220
to stay here with me all the time.

127
00:05:54,860 --> 00:05:55,659
Grandma,

128
00:05:56,010 --> 00:05:57,670
just focus on getting better.

129
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:59,970
I have nothing to take care of.

130
00:06:00,890 --> 00:06:01,690
All right.

131
00:06:01,930 --> 00:06:02,430
Come on,

132
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:04,360
let's get you covered up.

133
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,220
Get some sleep.

134
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:07,890
Okay.

135
00:06:08,890 --> 00:06:09,690
Alright.

136
00:06:10,890 --> 00:06:11,690
Go to sleep.

137
00:06:12,130 --> 00:06:13,460
I'll stay here with you.

138
00:06:28,290 --> 00:06:29,090
Yun Li, Yun Li!

139
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:30,890
What is it?

140
00:06:31,620 --> 00:06:32,500
You have no idea

141
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,600
what a big deal happened yesterday!

142
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,000
What happened?

143
00:06:36,420 --> 00:06:37,450
I never thought

144
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,090
Du Gefei would get
what was coming to her.

145
00:06:39,090 --> 00:06:40,880
It's so satisfying!

146
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:42,810
Mr. Xu's younger brother was incredible.

147
00:06:42,810 --> 00:06:44,500
He put her firmly in her place.

148
00:06:45,510 --> 00:06:46,510
Congratulations!

149
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:48,500
You've finally been vindicated.

150
00:06:48,500 --> 00:06:49,060
Wait,

151
00:06:49,090 --> 00:06:50,170
whose younger brother?

152
00:06:50,170 --> 00:06:51,970
What happened with Fu Zhengchu?

153
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:53,159
Yesterday, Mr. Xu's younger brother

154
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:54,250
exposed

155
00:06:54,250 --> 00:06:55,620
Du Gefei for smearing you
in her online posts,

156
00:06:55,620 --> 00:06:57,250
right in front of everyone!

157
00:06:58,100 --> 00:06:59,630
You have to watch the video.

158
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:01,750
It's already been posted online,

159
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,850
and people are all calling her out.

160
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,560
I sincerely apologize.

161
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:09,220
All the allegations I posted
about Idle Cloud

162
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:10,690
were fabricated.

163
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,800
Please stop believing

164
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:13,950
and spreading them.

165
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:15,120
I'd like

166
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:17,710
to apologize to Idle Cloud personally.

167
00:07:25,310 --> 00:07:26,120
Fu Zhengchu,

168
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,720
try some of my homemade cookies.

169
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:30,040
Okay.

170
00:07:32,490 --> 00:07:33,290
Fu Zhengchu,

171
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,690
thank you. Seriously.

172
00:07:36,310 --> 00:07:37,070
You don't have

173
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:37,540
to thank me, Lili.

174
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:38,130
You've said thank you

175
00:07:38,130 --> 00:07:38,830
like 800 times already.

176
00:07:38,830 --> 00:07:39,430
J-Just

177
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:40,220
one last time.

178
00:07:40,220 --> 00:07:40,540
Really,

179
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:41,330
if it weren't for you,

180
00:07:41,330 --> 00:07:43,370
I wouldn't have been able
to prove my innocence.

181
00:07:43,370 --> 00:07:44,070
Honestly,

182
00:07:44,070 --> 00:07:45,270
it was no big deal.

183
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,630
This kind of thing

184
00:07:46,630 --> 00:07:48,430
is a piece of cake for me.

185
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:49,270
I may have had

186
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:50,480
to use a little of my charm,

187
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,770
but that's no big deal

188
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,580
for a handsome guy like me.

189
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:54,310
You sure have

190
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:55,840
a high opinion of yourself.

191
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:58,180
It's not that you're charming.

192
00:07:58,180 --> 00:07:59,770
She's just easy to impress.

193
00:08:00,430 --> 00:08:01,070
Tang Lin,

194
00:08:01,070 --> 00:08:01,570
did you swallow

195
00:08:01,570 --> 00:08:02,480
some medicated oil or something?

196
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,740
Why do you always
have to make snide remarks?

197
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:04,870
If you'd seen

198
00:08:04,870 --> 00:08:06,980
my brilliant performance that night,

199
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:08,580
you'd have thought I was 007.

200
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,320
But seriously, Lili,

201
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,620
if you really want to thank someone,

202
00:08:12,620 --> 00:08:13,310
you should thank—

203
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:13,830
Enough!

204
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:16,630
Even a blind squirrel
finds a nut once in a while,

205
00:08:16,630 --> 00:08:18,490
and now you're bragging about it.

206
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:19,240
Lili, let's go.

207
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,500
Let's get back inside.

208
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:23,560
What's that about?

209
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,890
I wasn't even finished.

210
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:28,570
Tangy.

211
00:08:30,830 --> 00:08:31,720
What's wrong?

212
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:33,980
Still upset?

213
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:39,120
Regretting throwing up
too soon that night?

214
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:41,030
I told you not to drink so much.

215
00:08:44,010 --> 00:08:45,140
I've made up my mind.

216
00:08:45,220 --> 00:08:46,480
I'm done pursuing him.

217
00:08:47,890 --> 00:08:48,240
B-But

218
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,840
you know it was
all a misunderstanding, right?

219
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:52,780
It's got nothing to do with that.

220
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:55,670
Actually,
after I drank too much that night,

221
00:08:55,670 --> 00:08:57,530
I thought about it for a long time.

222
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,460
Maybe I'm just tired.

223
00:09:03,130 --> 00:09:04,030
He's like a stone

224
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:05,530
that no amount of warmth
can ever heat up.

225
00:09:05,530 --> 00:09:07,240
I've laid all my affection

226
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,620
at his feet,

227
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:10,000
but what about him?

228
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,840
He's still laughing and joking every day,

229
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,720
completely carefree,
like nothing matters.

230
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,740
A good relationship

231
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:16,480
should be a two-way street,

232
00:09:16,870 --> 00:09:18,340
not a one-woman show,

233
00:09:18,750 --> 00:09:19,320
right?

234
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,670
But if you give up just like that,

235
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:24,170
won't you regret it?

236
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,270
I think

237
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:27,200
if you

238
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:29,130
really like someone,

239
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,530
you should hang in there a little longer

240
00:09:31,530 --> 00:09:33,120
and give it another shot.

241
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:34,440
At least

242
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,370
get a clear answer from him, right?

243
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:39,770
Even if you hit a brick wall,

244
00:09:40,170 --> 00:09:41,220
at least you'll know you tried.

245
00:09:41,220 --> 00:09:43,020
Then you won't have any regrets.

246
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,530
But

247
00:09:47,170 --> 00:09:48,770
maybe letting go

248
00:09:48,770 --> 00:09:50,170
is the right thing for me.

249
00:09:50,870 --> 00:09:51,770
At least I won't have

250
00:09:51,770 --> 00:09:53,080
to keep worrying about
where I stand with him every day.

251
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,370
I won't have to keep staring at my phone,

252
00:09:54,370 --> 00:09:55,820
waiting for his messages.

253
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:56,580
And I won't be

254
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:57,980
so hung up

255
00:09:57,980 --> 00:09:59,910
on every little change in his mood.

256
00:10:05,530 --> 00:10:07,270
But don't let my experience influence you.

257
00:10:07,270 --> 00:10:08,740
Your situation is different from mine.

258
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:10,080
It's okay, Tangy.

259
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:10,720
Really,

260
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,980
I'll support

261
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,320
whatever you decide.

262
00:10:13,740 --> 00:10:14,670
I just want you

263
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:16,370
to always be

264
00:10:16,370 --> 00:10:18,440
that happy Tangy
without a care in the world.

265
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,130
Seriously,

266
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:20,320
if you're feeling down,

267
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,370
I'll go out for drinks with you

268
00:10:21,370 --> 00:10:22,030
right now.

269
00:10:22,030 --> 00:10:22,500
No,

270
00:10:23,650 --> 00:10:25,110
I'm never drinking again.

271
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:30,030
Honestly, I admire you.

272
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,290
You might think

273
00:10:31,290 --> 00:10:31,940
I'm an extrovert,

274
00:10:31,940 --> 00:10:33,740
but sometimes I'm such a coward.

275
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,630
You're different, though.

276
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:38,830
You're timid in little things,
but brave when it matters.

277
00:10:41,940 --> 00:10:43,130
How are things going with Fu Shize?

278
00:10:43,130 --> 00:10:44,930
Have you given him the drone yet?

279
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:45,910
Not yet.

280
00:10:46,740 --> 00:10:48,460
He returned my scarf,

281
00:10:48,670 --> 00:10:50,730
and we haven't seen each other since.

282
00:10:51,530 --> 00:10:53,060
Be a little more proactive.

283
00:11:04,890 --> 00:11:05,770
Here, Grandma.

284
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:10,740
Is it too hot?

285
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,520
No, it's fine.

286
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:14,550
Just right.

287
00:11:27,370 --> 00:11:28,080
Shize,

288
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,530
the engineering prototype has arrived.

289
00:11:29,530 --> 00:11:31,260
We'll test it when you get back.

290
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,410
Got it.

291
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:34,700
By the way,

292
00:11:35,650 --> 00:11:36,650
is there anything

293
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,340
on my desk?

294
00:11:38,370 --> 00:11:39,170
Let me check.

295
00:11:42,370 --> 00:11:43,100
There are...

296
00:11:43,810 --> 00:11:44,640
just a few books.

297
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:45,550
Nothing else.

298
00:12:03,130 --> 00:12:03,820
Hi, Yun Li.

299
00:12:05,340 --> 00:12:05,940
I'm off.

300
00:12:32,660 --> 00:12:35,930
[Inpatient]

301
00:13:02,410 --> 00:13:03,610
Why don't you come in?

302
00:13:04,740 --> 00:13:06,440
I just wanted to see Grandma.

303
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:07,910
Since she's resting,

304
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:09,050
I won't go in.

305
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,630
Maybe

306
00:13:18,510 --> 00:13:20,340
it's better if I stay away?

307
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:21,980
Grandma probably

308
00:13:21,980 --> 00:13:24,180
doesn't remember me anymore, does she?

309
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:28,180
Does she still think you're Yuan?

310
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:35,370
By the way,

311
00:13:35,910 --> 00:13:38,240
the school lab
was renovated a while back,

312
00:13:38,370 --> 00:13:39,130
and your drone

313
00:13:39,130 --> 00:13:40,260
is still at my place.

314
00:13:40,510 --> 00:13:42,570
I'll bring it to you next time we meet.

315
00:13:45,170 --> 00:13:46,240
Just keep it.

316
00:13:46,870 --> 00:13:47,720
As a keepsake.

317
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:52,220
I used to think the same way.

318
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:53,670
But now, I don't think

319
00:13:53,670 --> 00:13:55,270
any of that matters anymore.

320
00:13:56,580 --> 00:13:58,030
What truly matters

321
00:13:58,620 --> 00:14:00,820
has already found a place in our hearts,

322
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:01,630
hasn't it?

323
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,440
I had a dream the other night.

324
00:14:12,030 --> 00:14:14,030
In it, we'd graduated with our PhDs.

325
00:14:15,910 --> 00:14:17,030
I talked to Yuan

326
00:14:17,030 --> 00:14:18,960
about so many things in that dream,

327
00:14:19,770 --> 00:14:20,870
but I never told him the one thing

328
00:14:20,870 --> 00:14:22,220
that mattered most.

329
00:14:26,410 --> 00:14:27,530
Later, I found out

330
00:14:28,740 --> 00:14:30,670
that Yuan had feelings for me, too.

331
00:14:31,870 --> 00:14:32,270
And because

332
00:14:32,270 --> 00:14:34,130
of one little misunderstanding,

333
00:14:34,940 --> 00:14:36,530
we missed our chance.

334
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,910
That's when I realized that

335
00:14:40,340 --> 00:14:42,340
what you see isn't always the truth.

336
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:45,080
If only I'd

337
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:47,170
with Yuan back then,

338
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:45,840
cleared things up

339
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:51,480
would things have turned out differently?

340
00:15:10,980 --> 00:15:11,770
I'm sorry.

341
00:15:14,530 --> 00:15:15,320
Shize,

342
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,250
it's really not your fault.

343
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:19,220
Let's leave the past

344
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:21,270
in the past.

345
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:31,920
I'd better get going.

346
00:16:31,940 --> 00:16:33,670
Actually, the truth is out now.

347
00:16:35,910 --> 00:16:37,310
You don't have to resign.

348
00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:39,400
Do you really think

349
00:16:40,740 --> 00:16:42,630
I can stay here after all this?

350
00:16:46,370 --> 00:16:47,480
I can't stand

351
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,530
people looking at me differently.

352
00:16:55,390 --> 00:16:56,150
Yun Li,

353
00:16:58,720 --> 00:16:59,530
I'm sorry.

354
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:03,180
I hope you can forgive me.

355
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,440
Goodbye.

356
00:17:34,140 --> 00:17:34,720
Hello?

357
00:17:34,990 --> 00:17:36,480
Hey, I haven't been at the office
for the past couple of days.

358
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,810
Is there anything I need to take care of?

359
00:17:37,810 --> 00:17:38,610
No, nothing.

360
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:40,310
The company's been quiet
while you've been away.

361
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:41,770
Nothing major has come up.

362
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:43,850
Is Grandma ready to be discharged?

363
00:17:45,310 --> 00:17:46,110
That's good.

364
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:48,510
Let me ask you something.

365
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:50,940
If you wanted
to ask a girl out for dinner,

366
00:17:51,330 --> 00:17:52,830
what kind of restaurant would you choose?

367
00:17:52,830 --> 00:17:54,760
You're asking a girl out to dinner?

368
00:17:55,610 --> 00:17:56,920
Did I hear that right?

369
00:17:58,510 --> 00:17:59,310
Shize,

370
00:17:59,810 --> 00:18:01,330
you've finally caught on.

371
00:18:01,770 --> 00:18:02,570
Oh, cut it out.

372
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,840
Just help me figure this out.

373
00:18:16,070 --> 00:18:16,740
Jiang,

374
00:18:17,770 --> 00:18:18,530
Mom's back.

375
00:18:18,530 --> 00:18:19,190
She's back.

376
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:19,810
Grandma,

377
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:21,750
you should head inside first.

378
00:18:21,750 --> 00:18:22,510
Yuan,

379
00:18:22,830 --> 00:18:24,160
aren't you coming home?

380
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:30,480
Come in and sit for a while.

381
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,280
No, Ms. Jiang.

382
00:18:32,030 --> 00:18:34,110
I have something to take care of later.

383
00:18:34,110 --> 00:18:34,920
Yuan,

384
00:18:36,830 --> 00:18:38,360
take good care of yourself.

385
00:18:39,330 --> 00:18:40,590
Don't worry, Grandma.

386
00:18:40,870 --> 00:18:42,910
♪ The dusk settles slow ♪

387
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:42,930
I'll head back first, then.

388
00:18:42,930 --> 00:18:45,940
♪ Too faint of heart to follow through ♪

389
00:18:43,610 --> 00:18:44,220
Watch your step.

390
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:45,150
Watch your step.

391
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,000
♪ It's grown like a habit ♪

392
00:18:50,020 --> 00:18:53,020
♪ Awaiting dark clouds to spread ♪

393
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:57,640
♪ Fear promises are shallow ♪

394
00:18:59,130 --> 00:19:01,130
♪ No match for the tides of change ♪

395
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:02,880
I heard Engineer Fu is going

396
00:19:02,740 --> 00:19:07,150
♪ Let rain soak all that once was ours ♪

397
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:05,140
on a date with a girl
he's known for years.

398
00:19:07,030 --> 00:19:08,180
Fu Shize?

399
00:19:08,770 --> 00:19:09,680
Surprised?

400
00:19:10,030 --> 00:19:11,240
No wonder he's always been

401
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:12,680
so unapproachable at work.

402
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:15,410
Turns out he's had someone
in his heart all along.

403
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:17,590
I even thought

404
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:18,720
you two were dating.

405
00:19:20,810 --> 00:19:21,480
Then...

406
00:19:22,180 --> 00:19:23,710
with someone as cold as him,

407
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:26,070
what kind of girl does he like?

408
00:19:26,510 --> 00:19:28,030
I don't know the details.

409
00:19:28,530 --> 00:19:31,180
But I heard she's really pretty,

410
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:32,430
has a great personality,

411
00:19:32,430 --> 00:19:33,600
and is very capable.

412
00:19:33,620 --> 00:19:35,820
They're a perfect match for each other.

413
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:38,440
I didn't expect

414
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:40,420
Engineer Fu to be so devoted.

415
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:45,680
N-No way, right?

416
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:48,440
Guess even he can fall in love!

417
00:19:49,030 --> 00:19:50,610
But I'm curious, too.

418
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:52,810
Does it really take someone like him

419
00:19:52,810 --> 00:19:53,810
this long

420
00:19:54,070 --> 00:19:55,640
to win a girl over?

421
00:19:59,890 --> 00:20:03,170
I heard you're going
on a date with someone.

422
00:20:04,370 --> 00:20:06,190
♪ A thin short line ♪

423
00:20:06,210 --> 00:20:09,830
♪ Two hearts intertwined ♪

424
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:08,590
You're a wonderful person.

425
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:09,850
Thank you

426
00:20:09,850 --> 00:20:11,640
for always taking care of me.

427
00:20:11,560 --> 00:20:13,560
♪ Which way to go ♪

428
00:20:11,790 --> 00:20:12,740
Maybe

429
00:20:12,810 --> 00:20:14,770
I have no right to say this,

430
00:20:13,850 --> 00:20:16,830
♪ Might be simpler so ♪

431
00:20:14,940 --> 00:20:16,050
but I hope

432
00:20:16,050 --> 00:20:17,640
you'll take better care of yourself.

433
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:19,940
You're the best person I've ever known,

434
00:20:18,870 --> 00:20:20,620
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

435
00:20:20,030 --> 00:20:22,030
and you deserve the best.

436
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:24,640
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

437
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:24,290
I heard you've met someone you like.

438
00:20:24,420 --> 00:20:25,750
Thank you for coming into my life.

439
00:20:25,710 --> 00:20:31,010
♪ Hesitant feet—which side
should I stand on ♪

440
00:20:26,590 --> 00:20:28,120
I won't bother you anymore.

441
00:20:33,510 --> 00:20:36,190
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

442
00:20:36,210 --> 00:20:37,800
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

443
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:39,630
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

444
00:20:39,650 --> 00:20:42,620
♪ This damp murmur ♪

445
00:20:42,910 --> 00:20:47,380
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

446
00:20:45,930 --> 00:20:48,130
[Delete Contact]

447
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:51,390
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

448
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:54,540
♪ Resentment takes root inside ♪

449
00:20:55,070 --> 00:21:00,410
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

450
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:02,280
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

451
00:21:02,310 --> 00:21:05,830
♪ Maybe someday ♪

452
00:21:05,850 --> 00:21:08,450
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

453
00:21:08,790 --> 00:21:15,500
♪ I hope you write
the ending of our tale ♪

454
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:25,770
♪ I hope you write
the ending of our tale ♪

455
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,070
Hello?

456
00:21:38,320 --> 00:21:39,140
I've got the restaurant

457
00:21:39,140 --> 00:21:40,310
sorted out for you.

458
00:21:40,380 --> 00:21:41,240
Let me tell you,

459
00:21:41,380 --> 00:21:42,770
I asked a ton of people

460
00:21:42,830 --> 00:21:44,680
before finally settling on this place.

461
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:46,210
I'll send you the location.

462
00:21:47,450 --> 00:21:48,630
[Skyline Bistro]

463
00:21:50,330 --> 00:21:51,310
Skyline Bistro?

464
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:52,610
It's on the top floor

465
00:21:52,610 --> 00:21:54,220
of Tianqi Mall.

466
00:21:54,380 --> 00:21:55,420
The food is great,

467
00:21:55,510 --> 00:21:57,030
but the view is even better.

468
00:21:57,030 --> 00:21:57,740
You can take in

469
00:21:57,740 --> 00:21:59,330
the entire city of Nanwu at night.

470
00:21:59,330 --> 00:22:01,420
It's the perfect place
to take a girl on a date.

471
00:22:01,420 --> 00:22:02,680
Just imagine it.

472
00:22:03,070 --> 00:22:04,610
You two can eat and chat,

473
00:22:04,740 --> 00:22:06,330
growing closer

474
00:22:06,530 --> 00:22:08,240
as you gaze at the moon together.

475
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:09,530
Once you've had enough of the moon,

476
00:22:09,530 --> 00:22:11,440
just look down

477
00:22:11,660 --> 00:22:12,770
at a sea

478
00:22:13,570 --> 00:22:15,480
of lights stretching across the city.

479
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:17,140
It couldn't be more romantic!

480
00:22:19,350 --> 00:22:20,180
Xu Qingsong,

481
00:22:22,110 --> 00:22:23,310
what should I prepare

482
00:22:23,870 --> 00:22:25,070
for a date with a girl?

483
00:22:25,940 --> 00:22:26,740
What a waste

484
00:22:26,740 --> 00:22:28,470
of that handsome face of yours!

485
00:22:28,700 --> 00:22:29,220
You've made it this far in life

486
00:22:29,220 --> 00:22:30,720
without any dating experience.

487
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:32,140
It's not that complicated.

488
00:22:32,140 --> 00:22:34,310
Flowers, beautiful scenery,
and little gifts.

489
00:22:34,310 --> 00:22:35,030
Of course,

490
00:22:35,030 --> 00:22:36,490
she has to be into you, too.

491
00:22:36,610 --> 00:22:39,410
Otherwise, nothing you do
will make a difference.

492
00:22:39,980 --> 00:22:41,040
I think she might be

493
00:22:42,180 --> 00:22:43,310
a little into me.

494
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,570
What makes you say that?

495
00:22:45,810 --> 00:22:47,380
That's none of your business.

496
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:48,460
How is it none—

497
00:22:54,070 --> 00:22:55,270
You ungrateful jerk!

498
00:23:01,570 --> 00:23:07,980
[Are you free tomorrow? I know
a nice restaurant.
Would you like to go with me?]

499
00:23:11,740 --> 00:23:12,340
Forget it.

500
00:23:13,140 --> 00:23:14,470
I'll tell her in person.

501
00:23:35,140 --> 00:23:35,830
Hello!

502
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:36,810
Welcome.

503
00:23:37,770 --> 00:23:38,880
What kind of flowers are you looking for?

504
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,480
I can recommend some for you.

505
00:23:43,330 --> 00:23:44,140
I...

506
00:23:44,740 --> 00:23:46,330
Who are the flowers for?

507
00:23:46,330 --> 00:23:48,530
I can help you find something suitable.

508
00:23:50,330 --> 00:23:51,470
I want to give them

509
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:53,800
to a girl who's been by my side

510
00:23:54,270 --> 00:23:54,920
for many years

511
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,050
and means a lot to me.

512
00:23:58,640 --> 00:24:00,240
How about violets?

513
00:24:01,070 --> 00:24:02,380
They symbolize,

514
00:24:02,380 --> 00:24:03,740
"In a world you know nothing about,

515
00:24:03,740 --> 00:24:04,770
I'll love you

516
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:06,080
until the end of time.

517
00:24:06,530 --> 00:24:07,530
I hope you're the one I begin with

518
00:24:07,530 --> 00:24:08,790
and the one I end with."

519
00:24:11,850 --> 00:24:13,480
Yeah, I'll take those.

520
00:24:14,380 --> 00:24:15,440
Great. No problem.

521
00:24:50,660 --> 00:24:53,120
I guess I won't be giving you
to him after all.

522
00:25:31,140 --> 00:25:31,920
He already

523
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,510
likes someone else.

524
00:25:34,030 --> 00:25:35,160
What's the point

525
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:36,420
of adding him back now?

526
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:23,750
Hello?

527
00:26:23,840 --> 00:26:25,220
Your flower delivery is here.

528
00:26:25,220 --> 00:26:25,980
Yes,

529
00:26:26,470 --> 00:26:27,050
that's right.

530
00:26:27,050 --> 00:26:28,380
I'm at the entrance now.

531
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:44,500
Your number ends in 0237,
and you're Mr. Fu, right?

532
00:26:44,500 --> 00:26:44,850
Great.

533
00:26:44,850 --> 00:26:46,450
Could you sign here, please?

534
00:26:52,100 --> 00:26:52,810
Here's your bouquet.

535
00:26:52,810 --> 00:26:53,500
Thank you.

536
00:26:57,030 --> 00:26:58,680
Does he have a date today?

537
00:26:58,790 --> 00:27:00,140
He even got a bouquet.

538
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:27,280
Would you like

539
00:27:29,830 --> 00:27:30,960
to get coffee today?

540
00:27:33,910 --> 00:27:34,650
No, thanks!

541
00:28:00,740 --> 00:28:02,890
[Add to Contacts]

542
00:28:06,530 --> 00:28:08,070
He didn't even notice

543
00:28:08,070 --> 00:28:10,330
I'd removed him from my WeChat contacts.

544
00:28:19,330 --> 00:28:20,120
Hello?

545
00:28:20,310 --> 00:28:21,110
Hi,

546
00:28:21,310 --> 00:28:22,440
this is Yin Yucheng.

547
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:23,310
Hi.

548
00:28:23,310 --> 00:28:24,720
What can I do for you?

549
00:28:25,070 --> 00:28:26,570
Could we meet up and talk?

550
00:28:27,060 --> 00:28:28,820
It's about Yun Ye and Yunyi.

551
00:28:29,420 --> 00:28:30,640
What's happened to them?

552
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,270
It's a bit complicated

553
00:28:31,270 --> 00:28:32,220
to explain over the phone.

554
00:28:32,220 --> 00:28:33,350
Let's meet and talk.

555
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:35,160
Okay.

556
00:28:36,510 --> 00:28:37,040
Bye-bye.

557
00:28:44,380 --> 00:28:45,180
Thank you.

558
00:28:45,610 --> 00:28:46,270
No problem.

559
00:28:48,010 --> 00:28:49,140
Would you like something to eat?

560
00:28:49,140 --> 00:28:49,680
No, thanks.

561
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:51,810
I have to get back to work
at the office soon.

562
00:28:51,810 --> 00:28:52,440
Senior,

563
00:28:52,440 --> 00:28:54,880
is there something
you wanted to talk to me about?

564
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:55,680
I'm sorry

565
00:28:55,880 --> 00:28:57,240
for asking you to meet me so suddenly.

566
00:28:57,240 --> 00:28:59,510
This might be a little awkward
to talk about,

567
00:28:59,510 --> 00:29:00,980
but it's important,

568
00:29:01,010 --> 00:29:02,180
and I wanted you

569
00:29:02,330 --> 00:29:03,590
to be the first to know.

570
00:29:12,310 --> 00:29:14,610
Ever since Yunyi
started boarding at school,

571
00:29:14,610 --> 00:29:15,380
I've been the one collecting the mail

572
00:29:15,380 --> 00:29:16,480
sent to our house.

573
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:17,140
I noticed

574
00:29:17,140 --> 00:29:18,420
that ever since we moved to Nanwu,

575
00:29:18,420 --> 00:29:19,580
she's been getting postcards

576
00:29:19,580 --> 00:29:20,980
from her old classmates.

577
00:29:21,070 --> 00:29:22,220
About three a week.

578
00:29:22,220 --> 00:29:23,310
In less than a month,

579
00:29:23,310 --> 00:29:24,840
she's received almost ten.

580
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:27,480
Yunyi must be pretty popular.

581
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:32,070
The postcards are all signed
by Class 15 of Grade 11,

582
00:29:32,070 --> 00:29:33,830
but I compared the handwriting,

583
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:35,690
and it's identical on all of them.

584
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:39,070
It's the same handwriting

585
00:29:39,360 --> 00:29:41,160
as on the gift box last time, too.

586
00:29:43,070 --> 00:29:44,530
Yun Ye...

587
00:29:44,660 --> 00:29:46,090
Unbelievable.

588
00:29:46,510 --> 00:29:47,830
If I'm not mistaken,

589
00:29:48,720 --> 00:29:50,580
Yun Ye must have written them all.

590
00:29:51,140 --> 00:29:52,270
That's what I think.

591
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:54,880
Don't you want to read the letters?

592
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:55,570
I'd rather not.

593
00:29:55,570 --> 00:29:57,770
I don't feel right reading his letters.

594
00:29:57,830 --> 00:29:59,490
You don't feel right about it?

595
00:30:00,140 --> 00:30:01,770
Well, they're private.

596
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:05,270
There's nothing much in them, actually.

597
00:30:05,270 --> 00:30:05,680
Just simple

598
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:07,750
greetings and words of encouragement.

599
00:30:07,750 --> 00:30:08,330
If it weren't

600
00:30:08,330 --> 00:30:09,480
affecting their studies,

601
00:30:09,480 --> 00:30:10,940
I wouldn't want to interfere, either.

602
00:30:10,940 --> 00:30:12,680
But kids that age

603
00:30:12,680 --> 00:30:13,980
can be fickle.

604
00:30:15,070 --> 00:30:17,030
Let's keep the lines
of communication open.

605
00:30:17,030 --> 00:30:18,380
If you hear anything,

606
00:30:19,010 --> 00:30:19,980
give me a call anytime.

607
00:30:19,980 --> 00:30:20,240
Okay.

608
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:21,970
I'll talk to him
when I get back.

609
00:30:25,070 --> 00:30:25,510
Senior,

610
00:30:25,510 --> 00:30:27,850
there's just one thing
I wanted to ask you.

611
00:30:28,160 --> 00:30:28,960
Go ahead.

612
00:30:29,610 --> 00:30:31,340
Has Yunyi

613
00:30:31,370 --> 00:30:33,510
ever written back to Yun Ye?

614
00:30:36,270 --> 00:30:37,220
I don't think so.

615
00:30:44,010 --> 00:30:45,480
Thanks for coming all this way.

616
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:45,850
No problem.

617
00:30:45,850 --> 00:30:46,310
I'll have a serious talk with Yun Ye

618
00:30:46,310 --> 00:30:47,680
when I get back.

619
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:50,960
You don't need to put
too much pressure on him, either.

620
00:30:56,810 --> 00:30:57,310
Yun Li.

621
00:30:58,830 --> 00:30:59,770
Fu Shize.

622
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:02,810
Long time no see.

623
00:31:02,920 --> 00:31:03,980
Do you remember me?

624
00:31:06,570 --> 00:31:07,900
You two know each other?

625
00:31:08,810 --> 00:31:09,790
We used to be captains

626
00:31:09,790 --> 00:31:11,170
of drone teams.

627
00:31:11,190 --> 00:31:12,720
We competed
against each other several times.

628
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:14,250
You could say we were old rivals.

629
00:31:14,250 --> 00:31:15,050
Rivals?

630
00:31:18,050 --> 00:31:19,310
I need to talk to Yun Li.

631
00:31:19,510 --> 00:31:20,500
And you are?

632
00:31:21,010 --> 00:31:21,610
We're—

633
00:31:21,610 --> 00:31:22,350
Coworkers.

634
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:25,270
Y-You said you needed
to talk to me, right?

635
00:31:25,270 --> 00:31:25,980
Let's go.

636
00:31:26,010 --> 00:31:27,340
Senior, I'll get going.

637
00:31:27,460 --> 00:31:28,590
Go ahead. Take care.

638
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:50,550
W-What did you want to see me about?

639
00:31:54,750 --> 00:31:55,750
Wasn't that drone

640
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:58,420
for me?

641
00:32:02,090 --> 00:32:02,700
No.

642
00:32:06,950 --> 00:32:07,610
I've got something to do.

643
00:32:07,610 --> 00:32:08,670
I should get going.

644
00:32:25,610 --> 00:32:26,940
I want to give this drone

645
00:32:27,610 --> 00:32:28,810
to someone

646
00:32:28,810 --> 00:32:30,010
very important to me.

647
00:32:50,980 --> 00:32:52,710
Haven't you finished work yet?

648
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:54,500
What about you?

649
00:32:54,870 --> 00:32:55,850
Not for a while.

650
00:34:22,800 --> 00:34:25,610
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

651
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:29,010
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

652
00:34:29,810 --> 00:34:32,219
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

653
00:34:32,239 --> 00:34:35,440
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

654
00:34:36,350 --> 00:34:39,440
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

655
00:34:39,940 --> 00:34:42,100
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

656
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:45,400
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

657
00:34:46,100 --> 00:34:49,400
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

658
00:34:50,969 --> 00:34:53,900
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

659
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:56,080
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

660
00:34:57,960 --> 00:35:00,910
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

661
00:35:00,930 --> 00:35:03,220
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

662
00:35:04,300 --> 00:35:07,870
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

663
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:10,900
♪ To meet the moon ♪

664
00:35:10,930 --> 00:35:13,860
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

665
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:16,770
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

666
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:20,960
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

667
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:24,150
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

668
00:35:22,230 --> 00:35:22,900
Yun Li.

669
00:35:24,260 --> 00:35:28,000
♪ Love gives us all ♪

670
00:35:28,020 --> 00:35:31,080
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

671
00:35:31,100 --> 00:35:31,920
♪ You know ♪

672
00:35:31,940 --> 00:35:35,180
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

673
00:35:35,200 --> 00:35:38,010
♪ No matter how many times I say
I love you ♪

674
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:36,500
Yun Li.

675
00:35:38,040 --> 00:35:41,620
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

676
00:35:42,510 --> 00:35:47,410
♪ I could say it ten thousand times
and never tire ♪

677
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:48,570
Yun Lili.

678
00:35:59,040 --> 00:36:02,310
♪ Practice the poem of love
time and again ♪

679
00:36:02,340 --> 00:36:05,740
♪ Where should I begin
with these soft and low whispers? ♪

680
00:36:05,760 --> 00:36:08,900
♪ The moonlight is
gently cast upon your name ♪

681
00:36:07,170 --> 00:36:09,280
Did you just call my name?

682
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:13,120
♪ I look up,
and you're always there, so tenderly ♪

683
00:36:10,460 --> 00:36:11,390
You were asleep.

684
00:36:13,370 --> 00:36:15,820
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

685
00:36:14,820 --> 00:36:16,480
What's up?

686
00:36:15,850 --> 00:36:18,480
♪ Through ceaseless tides
that ebb and flow ♪

687
00:36:18,820 --> 00:36:19,940
I'm about to head out.

688
00:36:19,940 --> 00:36:22,440
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

689
00:36:19,940 --> 00:36:21,480
I saw the lights were still on in here.

690
00:36:22,460 --> 00:36:25,850
♪ As we feel the changes of seasons ♪

691
00:36:26,430 --> 00:36:30,000
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

692
00:36:30,170 --> 00:36:33,030
♪ To meet the moon ♪

693
00:36:31,510 --> 00:36:32,170
Ready to go?

694
00:36:33,060 --> 00:36:35,740
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

695
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:38,900
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

696
00:36:35,780 --> 00:36:36,510
You want me

697
00:36:36,610 --> 00:36:37,730
to go with you?

698
00:36:39,070 --> 00:36:43,230
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

699
00:36:40,920 --> 00:36:42,630
I can get home on my own.

700
00:36:43,420 --> 00:36:46,290
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

701
00:36:44,110 --> 00:36:45,110
It's not very safe

702
00:36:45,710 --> 00:36:46,530
out there lately.

703
00:36:46,390 --> 00:36:50,130
♪ Love gives us all ♪

704
00:36:48,380 --> 00:36:50,150
I'm waiting for a file from a coworker.

705
00:36:50,150 --> 00:36:53,210
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

706
00:36:50,260 --> 00:36:51,590
You go ahead.

707
00:36:53,330 --> 00:36:54,150
♪ You know ♪

708
00:36:54,180 --> 00:36:57,420
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

709
00:36:57,440 --> 00:37:00,250
♪ No matter how many times I say
I love you ♪

710
00:37:00,280 --> 00:37:03,860
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

711
00:37:04,750 --> 00:37:10,570
♪ I could say it ten thousand times
and never tire ♪

712
00:38:13,560 --> 00:38:14,870
Why are you still here?

713
00:38:15,420 --> 00:38:16,620
I was waiting for you.

714
00:38:19,340 --> 00:38:19,900
Let's go.

715
00:38:20,860 --> 00:38:21,420
Okay.

716
00:38:55,450 --> 00:38:57,030
Am I walking too fast?

717
00:39:15,540 --> 00:39:16,630
Have you not had dinner yet?

718
00:39:16,630 --> 00:39:17,320
No.

719
00:39:17,440 --> 00:39:18,210
Actually, tonight, I...

720
00:39:18,210 --> 00:39:19,690
I know you have things to do.

721
00:39:19,690 --> 00:39:20,070
It's okay.

722
00:39:20,070 --> 00:39:20,940
Just take care of your own stuff.

723
00:39:20,940 --> 00:39:21,980
Don't worry about me.

724
00:39:21,980 --> 00:39:22,400
I...

725
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:23,320
The guesthouse is just up ahead.

726
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:24,320
I'm almost there.

727
00:39:24,320 --> 00:39:24,920
Bye-bye.

728
00:39:47,380 --> 00:39:48,180
Good evening,

729
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,110
Shize.

730
00:39:50,420 --> 00:39:51,110
I feel like

731
00:39:51,110 --> 00:39:53,040
I've regained a lot more memories.

732
00:39:53,110 --> 00:39:55,170
Was it you
who helped me get them back?

733
00:39:55,360 --> 00:39:56,150
Yeah.

734
00:40:02,380 --> 00:40:03,180
What's wrong?

735
00:40:04,130 --> 00:40:05,460
Something on your mind?

736
00:40:10,820 --> 00:40:11,610
Yuan,

737
00:40:13,620 --> 00:40:14,620
remember the girl

738
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:16,610
I told you about

739
00:40:16,610 --> 00:40:17,510
last time?

740
00:40:17,570 --> 00:40:18,380
Yup, I do.

741
00:40:19,420 --> 00:40:20,280
How's it going?

742
00:40:20,670 --> 00:40:22,070
Are you two together now?

743
00:40:25,610 --> 00:40:26,420
Not yet.

744
00:40:26,570 --> 00:40:27,460
Still not?

745
00:40:28,480 --> 00:40:30,340
Don't tell me you still don't know

746
00:40:30,860 --> 00:40:33,190
how to win a girl over,
just like back then.

747
00:40:34,550 --> 00:40:35,610
You got that right.

748
00:40:37,550 --> 00:40:38,710
She's the girl

749
00:40:39,150 --> 00:40:40,110
who played robot soccer

750
00:40:40,110 --> 00:40:40,880
back then.

751
00:40:41,610 --> 00:40:42,540
Wait, it was her?

752
00:40:43,490 --> 00:40:44,790
You were already

753
00:40:44,810 --> 00:40:46,670
so into her back then, weren't you?

754
00:40:46,670 --> 00:40:48,570
You were clearly smitten with her,

755
00:40:48,570 --> 00:40:50,850
yet you still made me
deliver that little soccer ball to her.

756
00:40:50,850 --> 00:40:52,050
If you'd confessed

757
00:40:52,380 --> 00:40:53,650
your feelings sooner,

758
00:40:53,650 --> 00:40:54,320
you wouldn't

759
00:40:54,320 --> 00:40:56,850
be dealing
with all these complications now.

760
00:40:57,630 --> 00:40:58,420
Yeah.
